lid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-28/03-nanbeige-nanbeige4-3-33b.png\" alt=\"Nanbeige/Nanbeige4.3-33B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">Nanbeige/Nanbeige4.3-33B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Nanbeige4.3-33B是一款具备中等规模参数量的高性能大语言模型。其定位在于平衡逻辑推理能力与知识覆盖广度，能够处理复杂的中文语义理解及长文本生成任务。凭借其33B的参数规模，该模型在对话理解、内容创作及复杂逻辑分析方面表现稳健，非常适合企业级知识库问答及深入的文本分析场景。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-28/04-xhtoken-spark-x2-6-4b.png\" alt=\"XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Spark-X2.6-4B是一款专注于终端侧智能体（On-Device Agents）的轻量级模型。该模型针对实时环境中的复杂任务处理进行了深度优化，具备出色的推理效率与多任务适应性。其紧凑的尺寸使其能够在资源受限的移动设备或嵌入式硬件上稳定运行，是实现离线智能助手及自动化任务执行的理想选择。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-28/05-black-forest-labs-flux-3-image-klein-comfy.png\" alt=\"black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">FLUX 3 Image Klein是一款5.6B参数规模的开放权重图像生成模型。它集成Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct作为文本编码器，支持从文本到图像的创作以及基于单张或多张参考图的图像编辑。该模型具备灵活的多参考图合成能力，适用于图像修复、风格迁移及复杂视觉构图任务，为开发者提供了强大的视觉生成工具。</p></section></section></section><section sty